{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wm2g8lxrMR1794201350.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p> </p><p>利嘉閣地產東涌區高級聯席董事劉景駿表示，旗下團隊剛促成東涌藍天海岸 5 座低層 G 室二手租務交易，單位實用面積約 388 方呎，採一房間隔。</p><p> </p><p>劉氏補充，新租客為專業人士，原住九龍區，為方便往返機場工作決定搬至東涌。考量到區內一房放盤短缺，客人經利嘉閣「真盤源」平台鎖定上址後即時約睇樓；參觀後認為屋苑位置便利，開則四正，遂決定「即睇即租」，以16,000 元承租，實用呎租約 41.2 元。</p><p> </p><p>業主於2012年以約326萬元購入上址，現可享約5.9厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.672202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.461184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:17.597822+00:00","content_hash":"a7d4050c8d5db60ef1fbd5f48455df436fc15b8ca0e9bdca09652a4d56251e57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.672202+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}